  "about": {
    "title": "About the Dragons Exalted set",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Pokémon TCG: Dragons Exalted is a Black & White expansion released on 15 August 2012. It has 128 cards: 124 in the main set and 4 secret rares. There are also 111 reverse holos.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 124 main set cards), the <b>Master set</b> (235 cards, adding the reverse holos) or the <b>Grand Master set</b> (all 239 cards, adding the 4 secret rares).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device."
    ]
  },
